mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Files   inbox/; pattern=*.txt
2. <each triage_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Text   (input:1)
     2. Summarize               Ministral 3B; "One line: sender wants…"
     3. Classify    (1)         Ministral 3B; "Urgency? tags: act, read, ignore"
        -> { act: 4 | read: 5 | ignore: 6 }

     4. Template    (2)         "ACT     {1}"
        -> 7

     5. Template    (2)         "READ    {1}"
        -> 7

     6. Template    (2)         "IGNORE  {1}"
     7. Template                "{1}"
3. Sort         direction=asc   # ACT sorts to the top
4. Join Text    separator="\n"
5. Save Text    inbox-brief.md
